[{:db/id "q-49286/selection/f0f45940ed5df71758de7ff31ea171bc0689f380be113b3538530f3180b5105f" :answer/id #uuid "90d47605-dabb-54b0-b71e-566d6f7d665f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49286/selection/986e06f062dcc0ad37fbb185f7e0d56b0fd8e74b571035e7dc0af3d06af89951" :answer/id #uuid "6dd7c238-0f8c-5b16-a217-d1386176e1bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49286/selection/07a3540ad51bfb53d362c69b0c3835b387a5d7d769d089dc5189f608ec57d640" :answer/id #uuid "88151861-75ad-5e5d-a049-e83aa028ef9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49286/selection/7b1b8538b264eef6681d0ab5f3b14d51b6cdff67f34fba59d0886ae5c6acf80a" :answer/id #uuid "47c6df3b-118b-536b-ab2e-a17e3c312238" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49286/selection/d0ab94490dee12664d2f70471811316d5faf74c9c2c3f6dde546976ea292b76b" :answer/id #uuid "d3b4438a-9b6d-5673-a6b8-e8a3bc72b8fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49286/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d94537d-95f9-5179-95cd-10d218124d7e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49286/selection/f0f45940ed5df71758de7ff31ea171bc0689f380be113b3538530f3180b5105f" :answer-field/choices ["q-49286/selection/f0f45940ed5df71758de7ff31ea171bc0689f380be113b3538530f3180b5105f" "q-49286/selection/986e06f062dcc0ad37fbb185f7e0d56b0fd8e74b571035e7dc0af3d06af89951" "q-49286/selection/07a3540ad51bfb53d362c69b0c3835b387a5d7d769d089dc5189f608ec57d640" "q-49286/selection/7b1b8538b264eef6681d0ab5f3b14d51b6cdff67f34fba59d0886ae5c6acf80a" "q-49286/selection/d0ab94490dee12664d2f70471811316d5faf74c9c2c3f6dde546976ea292b76b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49286" :question/id #uuid "d13285f0-0de3-5f3e-aab5-8630896b0697" :question/math-academy-id "q-49286" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040941/assets/0f8e4dc1dff5673d8fc95375f9632f43bc4942335899e0e6dad11e8693bd6599.png)\n\nA region in the $xy$-plane is bounded by the curve $y=5{sin}^{2}⁡x,$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=0$ and $x=\\pi .$ The area of the region is" :question/worked-solution "The area of the region bounded by the curve $y=5{sin}^{2}⁡x,$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=0$ and $x=\\pi $ is \n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }5{sin}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)={sin}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }5{sin}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{sin}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}([\\pi -\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )]-[0-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot 0)]) \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-49286/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "31f3ead1-2549-5b61-baf9-0437ba28f09d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49286"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-361711"] :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040941/assets/f8aa97ff1ff27ec11df6aefd4523ed9d39efac686c777f7242701aa2f4fef79c.png)\n\nA region in the $xy$-plane is bounded by the curve $y=2{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+2-x,$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=0$ and $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$, as shown above. The area of the region is\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
